DevNull_36_1_1308               DevNull_36_1_1308               Oh, maya. That's a big job. I'm already dazed and kafir'd.
Christof_36_1_1309              Christof_36_1_1309              I thank thee for thy service, noble lunatic. Let us be off. Fare thee well, Dev/Null.
