Pink_37_3_1365                  Pink_37_3_1365                  No one understands him! He's insane! And Christof, you're as insane as he is if you believe this Sabbat freak's lies! Oh, yes! He's Sabbat! He's too busy lying about ol' Pink to tell you that, huh?
Christof_37_3_1366              Christof_37_3_1366              Is't the truth? Art thou now Sabbat?
Wilhem_37_3_1367                Wilhem_37_3_1367                Yes, it's true, Christof. I had no choice. The mighty Cosmas fell during the great battle in Prague, and we became too weak to attain our Promethian goals. . We needed new allies, but we refused to join the Ventrue and the Tremere in their Masquerade, their Camarilla. Ecaterina is an Archbishop of the Sabbat now, but she fights against the Sabbat who serve Vukodlak! Yes, I am Sabbat, but Pink is no Brujah!
Pink_37_3_1368                  Pink_37_3_1368                  Abdul Al-Hazim, master disciple of the Assamites at your service. You must admit I affected the idiotic Brujah aesthetic with flawless perfection. But now I must now take my leave of you, Christof. My taqiyya is finished. The Tzimisce charged me with preventing you from finding Exalted Master Vukodlak before he arises. Alas, they did not specify that I had to put my knife into your heart. So I let you kill my Setite enemies. And taking out that greasy Giovanni boss put the icing on the cake. Despite my best efforts, you came perilously close to finding Vukodlak. But now I have wasted so much of your time that you cannot possibly reach him before he arises, even if you knew where to look. Oh, and Christof. Sorry I did not help you out of the kindness of my heart. But no SANE vampire is that stupid. Farewell. Enjoy the New Year! And the new AGE!
