Wilhem_37_3_1371                Wilhem_37_3_1371                Good to meet you.
Christof_37_3_1372              Christof_37_3_1372              Forgive me, Wilhem. I should never have doubted thee. I thank thee for thy timely intervention.
Wilhem_37_3_1373                Wilhem_37_3_1373                Thank Dev/Null. The little bastard seems to know everything about everything in this town. He tried to tell you, but, well, he's not always very clear. The email he sent Ecaterina was nearly unintelligible, but we knew that "pissed-off Christof" had to be you.
Christof_37_3_1374              Christof_37_3_1374              Where is Ecaterina? I must thank my mistress for sending thee. And for her timely summons. She didst wake me from my Torpor in time to save me from the Society of Leopold.
Wilhem_37_3_1375                Wilhem_37_3_1375                Summons? Ecaterina sent no summons. I suppose she has the power to wake you, but she gave you up for dead a long time ago.
Christof_37_3_1376              Christof_37_3_1376              Then who...
Wilhem_37_3_1377                Wilhem_37_3_1377                I couldn't say.
Samuel_37_3_1378                Samuel_37_3_1378                Will you help us, Wilhem?
Wilhem_37_3_1379                Wilhem_37_3_1379                Gladly. Ecaterina has directed me to work with you in finding and destroying Vukodlak.
Christof_37_3_1380              Christof_37_3_1380              Why doth she contend 'gainst her fellow Sabbat lord?
Wilhem_37_3_1381                Wilhem_37_3_1381                Ecaterina would like to stop the Antediluvians. But if Vukodlak succeeds in rising with the power to consume them, he will become the most powerful being on earth. He's too unstable to wield that kind of power. It would doom Kindred and mortals alike.
Lily_37_3_1382                  Lily_37_3_1382                  How horrible.
Wilhem_37_3_1383                Wilhem_37_3_1383                The time for the fiend's reawakening is approaching. On New Year's Eve, the Tzimisce koldun's spell will be broken, and he will arise from torpor. The Promethians have been preparing for this time. Most of the last millennia has been spent trying to find and destroy him before this could occur. Of course, the Camarilla has taken much of our attention since then.
Christof_37_3_1384              Christof_37_3_1384              Wilhem, thou told me of thy passion for the Road of Humanitas. How couldst thou join wicked creatures like the Sabbat?
Wilhem_37_3_1385                Wilhem_37_3_1385                A lot can happen in eight hundred years... In a way, you were lucky. Lucky to be spared what I have seen... what I have done... what I had to do! There is very little humanity left in me.
Christof_37_3_1386              Christof_37_3_1386              Then come! Let us redeem thy humanity with our good works! Let us put the lie to the assassin, and prevent the rise of Vukodlak! Then may we cry out to the reverberate hills that we have reclaimed our lost humanity!
Wilhem_37_3_1387                Wilhem_37_3_1387                Yes.
