Christof_37_4_1397              Christof_37_4_1397              So perhaps I require knowledge of thy New Age.
Emelia_37_4_1398                Emelia_37_4_1398                Anything you want. But I don't know what your friend is talking about. You don't look a day over three hundred! And you look damn good.
