Wilhem_38_1_1405                Wilhem_38_1_1405                I am eager to see Orsi again. I have a gift for him.
Christof_38_1_1406              Christof_38_1_1406              We seek Orsi. I...did business with him long ago, and I owe him a debt.
Fred_38_1_1407                  Fred_38_1_1407                  Then you're about two days too late. He sold the place to me for a song and moved out. Hi, I'm Fred Varney. I'm in real estate. I'm looking for a buyer for the place. Beautiful townhouse. The Barclay South.
