Christof_38_1_1452              Christof_38_1_1452              The address of Orsi's factory! Let us go!
Alexandra_38_1_1453             Alexandra_38_1_1453             My thanks to you, Christof. Lily tells me you are a great Kindred.
Christof_38_1_1454              Christof_38_1_1454              We are well pleased with her, as well.
Alexandra_38_1_1455             Alexandra_38_1_1455             I'd love to paint you. You have a very noble brow. I owe you everything for saving me. Good luck on your mission.
Lily_38_1_1456                  Lily_38_1_1456                  May I go with  them, Alexandra?
Alexandra_38_1_1457             Alexandra_38_1_1457             Lily, my lovely thrall, it grieves me to let you go so soon after finding you again. But Orsi must die to free you from your bondage. Go with my blessings, and give Orsi my regards when you crush him like the toad he is.
Lily_38_1_1458                  Lily_38_1_1458                  Thank you!
Christof_38_1_1459              Christof_38_1_1459              Farewell till we meet again, Alexandra.
Alexandra_38_1_2546             Alexandra_38_1_2546             Please hurry! Orsi wants to ressurrect Vukodlak tonight! The demon that Orsi made me paint!
Ventrue_39_1_1460               Ventrue_39_1_1460               'Bout time you mooks got here wit that painting.
Ventrue_39_1_1461               Ventrue_39_1_1461               Yeah! It's almost V-day!
Alexandra_38_1_1430             Alexandra_38_1_1430             Don't kill me! I'm almost done! I didn't mean to be late, but I'm so weak.
Christof_38_1_1431              Christof_38_1_1431              We shall not kill thee.
Alexandra_38_1_1432             Alexandra_38_1_1432             Oh. (relaxes) I just need a little more time. And please, more blood, I beg of you. A rat, a little mouse, anything!
Lily_38_1_1433                  Lily_38_1_1433                  Alexandra! It's me! Lily!
Alexandra_38_1_1434             Alexandra_38_1_1434             ...Lily? They've taken you too? I had hoped you had escaped...
Christof_38_1_1435              Christof_38_1_1435              Who hath done this injustice unto you?
