Christof_38_1_1439              Christof_38_1_1439              Dry thy crimson tears. We do not serve Orsi. We seek his factory and we crave his death.
Alexandra_38_1_1440             Alexandra_38_1_1440             I don't know where his factory is. Only that they are coming to take this portrait there for his private New Year's Eve party tonight. I have to finish! If I don't, they'll kill me!
Samuel_38_1_1441                Samuel_38_1_1441                No one will kill you! We'll protect you to the end!
Alexandra_38_1_1442             Alexandra_38_1_1442             The end. The end comes soon...(weeping) Oh Lily, how sweet to see you again. And how bitter to find you only to lose you again...
Lily_38_1_1443                  Lily_38_1_1443                  But, we can be together forever!
Alexandra_38_1_1444             Alexandra_38_1_1444             No! No! There is no forever. He's returning! We have to get out of New York! Out of America! There's no place far enough we can run.
Christof_38_1_1445              Christof_38_1_1445              Peace, woman! What dost thou mean?
Alexandra_38_1_1446             Alexandra_38_1_1446             Vukodlak. The Tzimisce demon they made me paint. They resurrect him this night!
Christof_38_1_1447              Christof_38_1_1447              Then he rises in time to die!
Lily_38_1_1448                  Lily_38_1_1448                  Heads up! We've got company!
Ventrue_38_1_1449               Ventrue_38_1_1449               All right.  You better be finished, and it better be brilliant.
Christof_38_1_1450              Christof_38_1_1450              No. It is you who are finished.
Lily_38_1_1451                  Lily_38_1_1451                  And THAT will be brilliant!
Orsi_39_1_1468                  Orsi_39_1_1468                  Tonight we build a great silver statue in his honor! And into it we shall place the power of the most ancient blood. By this ritual shall we rule!
Christof_39_1_1469              Christof_39_1_1469              So, it is you!
Wilhem_39_1_1470                Wilhem_39_1_1470                We haven't forgotten your deeds in Vienna, Orsi!
Orsi_39_1_1471                  Orsi_39_1_1471                  Bless my soul! The Brujah! Could it be? Ecaterina's brood. How extraordinary! Wilhem, and... what was your name again, lad?
Christof_39_1_1472              Christof_39_1_1472              Mark my name well, Orsi. For the Devil will wish to know who delivered thee unto his cheerless realm. Tell the Devil thou wert dispatched from earth by Christof Romuald. Christof Romuald, whose soul he shall never posses, as long as there is hope beyond all hope in this world.
Orsi_39_1_1473                  Orsi_39_1_1473                  Well! I remember you now, crusader. You eliminated some competition for me in the old days. That tedious Lasombra churchman! I remember as if it was yesterday. You escaped my dungeon, you naughty boys.
Wilhem_39_1_1474                Wilhem_39_1_1474                We apologize for not killing you then. We'll make up for it today.
Lily_39_1_1475                  Lily_39_1_1475                  With a gallon of blood for every drop you've spilled from Alexandra.
Orsi_39_1_1476                  Orsi_39_1_1476                  Your hate is so delicious. My children, I'll make up for it in a far more valuable treasure than my humble blood. This is a new era, full of opportunities we could only begin to imagine in the Dark Ages. Then, I thought power came from the Church. That's why I had you kill Luther Black! Then times changed, and power grew from the temporal government. But do you know where power really comes from?
Wilhem_39_1_1477                Wilhem_39_1_1477                You bore me, businessman. Everyone knows that corporations rule today.
Orsi_39_1_1478                  Orsi_39_1_1478                  Wrong! All mortal power is fleeting! A new age is about to begin. An age where we Kindred are restored to rulership of the world! An age undreamed of! And it begins now! Tonight! At the eve of a new millennium!
Lily_39_1_1479                  Lily_39_1_1479                  The new millennium doesn't begin for another year. 2001.
Orsi_39_1_1480                  Orsi_39_1_1480                  Hush! We know what we're doing. Just think, Christof! An eternity of perfect power, with no Antediluvians to keep us in check!
Christof_39_1_1481              Christof_39_1_1481              So, thou art in league with the fiend! Where is Vukodlak?
Orsi_39_1_1482                  Orsi_39_1_1482                  Oh, you are so judgmental! Vukodlak acts on our behalf! If he does not, your Antediluvian grand-sire will rise up and drag you into the grave! But Vukodlak can pull them up first, and feed upon them.
Christof_39_1_1483              Christof_39_1_1483              And who will stop him then?
Orsi_39_1_1484                  Orsi_39_1_1484                  Stop him? He'll share power with you! He'll restore our rightful heritage as the true Gods of the earth! I can get you a place at the table with him. Your old friend has joined him willingly, and you can too. What was her name? The little nun?
