Christof_39_1_2551              Christof_39_1_2551              (Threaten them.)
Kazi_39_1_1490                  Kazi_39_1_1490                  Do not tell them sisters!
Kazi_39_1_1491                  Kazi_39_1_1491                  The fiend is below the blackened church, to the north. There you'll find him, below, in his Cathedral of Flesh. Little good this will do you now, as he arises in but a few moments.
